content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Store Clerk",
      "description": "Employee who processes purchases and manages frontline operations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person buying items at the store."
    },
    {
      "name": "Item Scan",
      "description": "Recorded scan of an item during checkout."
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "description": "Transfer of money from the customer for the purchase."
    },
    {
      "name": "Purchase",
      "description": "Transaction containing selected store items and a bill.",
      "attributes": [
        "Store Item",
        "Bill"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Store Item",
      "description": "Product available for sale in the store.",
      "attributes": [
        "Price"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Price",
      "description": "Cost assigned to a store item."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bill",
      "description": "Charge summary for a completed purchase."
    },
    {
      "name": "Low Stock Report",
      "description": "Notice indicating that a store item is running low."
    },
    {
      "name": "Store Manager",
      "description": "Person overseeing store operations, inventory and reporting."
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory Log",
      "description": "Record of store item quantities and movement.",
      "attributes": [
        "Store Item"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Replenishment Order",
      "description": "Order issued to supplier for more store items.",
      "attributes": [
        "Store Item"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Supplier",
      "description": "External provider that supplies items to the store."
    },
    {
      "name": "Stock Delivery",
      "description": "Arrival of ordered items from the supplier."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Volume Report",
      "description": "Summary report of item sales over a given period."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Checkout": {
      "objects": [
        "Store Clerk",
        "Customer",
        "Item Scan",
        "Purchase",
        "Store Item",
        "Bill",
        "Payment"
      ]
    },
    "Sales Analysis": {
      "objects": [
        "Purchase",
        "Sales Volume Report"
      ]
    },
    "Restocking": {
      "objects": [
        "Replenishment Order",
        "Store Item",
        "Supplier",
        "Stock Delivery"
      ]
    },
    "Inventory Keeping": {
      "objects": [
        "Store Manager",
        "Low Stock Report",
        "Inventory Log",
        "Store Item"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Checkout": {
      "derived from": "Checkout Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Store Clerk",
        "Customer",
        "Item Scan",
        "Purchase",
        "Store Item",
        "Bill",
        "Payment"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Sales Analysis": {
      "derived from": "Sales Analysis Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Purchase Record",
        "Sales Volume Report"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Purchase -> Purchase Record"
      ]
    },
    "Restocking": {
      "derived from": "Restocking Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Replenishment Order",
        "Ordered Item",
        "Supplier",
        "Stock Delivery"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Store Item -> Ordered Item"
      ]
    },
    "Inventory Keeping": {
      "derived from": "Inventory Keeping Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Store Manager",
        "Low Stock Report",
        "Inventory Log",
        "Item Record"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Store Item -> Item Record"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
